### ========== AUTHENTICATION ==========

### Login Admin
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@kostsejahtera.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

###

### Login Tenant
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "budi@example.com",
  "password": "tenant123"
}

###

### Get Current User
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

###

### ========== DASHBOARD ==========

### Get Admin Dashboard Stats
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dashboard/admin
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN

###

### Get Tenant Dashboard
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dashboard/tenant
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TENANT_TOKEN

###

### Get Financial Trend
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dashboard/financial-trend
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN

