### ========== ROOMS ==========

### Get All Rooms
GET http://localhost:3000/api/rooms

###

### Get Rooms - Filter VIP
GET http://localhost:3000/api/rooms?type=VIP

###

### Get Rooms - Available Only
GET http://localhost:3000/api/rooms?available=true

###

### Get Room by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/rooms/1

###

### Create Room
POST http://localhost:3000/api/rooms
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "room_number": "D-401",
  "type": "VIP",
  "floor": 4,
  "wing": "Kanan",
  "price": 2700000,
  "facilities": ["AC", "WiFi", "KM Dalam", "Balkon", "TV"]
}

###

### Update Room
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/rooms/1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 2600000,
  "is_available": true
}

###

### Delete Room
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/rooms/6
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN

###

