### ========== INVOICES ==========

### Get All Invoices
GET http://localhost:3000/api/invoices
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN

###

### Get My Invoices
GET http://localhost:3000/api/invoices/me
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TENANT_TOKEN

###

### Get Invoice by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/invoices/1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN

###

### Create Invoice
POST http://localhost:3000/api/invoices
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant_id": 1,
  "room_id": 1,
  "period": "Februari 2024",
  "issue_date": "2024-02-01",
  "due_date": "2024-03-05",
  "items": [
    { "description": "Sewa Kamar", "amount": 2000000 },
    { "description": "Listrik", "amount": 250000 },
    { "description": "Air", "amount": 100000 }
  ],
  "discount": 0
}

###

### Update Invoice Status
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/invoices/1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "paid"
}

###

### ========== TRANSACTIONS ==========

### Get All Transactions
GET http://localhost:3000/api/transactions
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN

###

### Get Transactions - Filter by Type
GET http://localhost:3000/api/transactions?type=expense
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN

###

### Get Transaction Summary
GET http://localhost:3000/api/transactions/summary
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN

###

### Create Transaction
POST http://localhost:3000/api/transactions
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "expense",
  "category": "Maintenance",
  "amount": 500000,
  "description": "Perbaikan AC kamar A-101",
  "date": "2024-01-15"
}

